              ]
            },
            "worked": "Let $t$ be Tiff's current age in years.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}t-8&=\\frac{t}{2}\\\\\\frac{t}{2}-8&=0\\\\\\frac{t}{2}&=8\\\\t&=16\\end{align*}$$\n\nTiff is 16 years old. Eight years ago she was 8, which is half of 16.",
